@COORDINATOR.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5201

### Commits: product 1 is seeded in Stock.API
POST {{COORDINATOR.API_HostAddress}}/create-order-transaction
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "John Doe",
  "customerEmail": "john.doe@example.com",
  "productId": 1
}

### Rolls back: product 99 does not exist, so the stock step aborts and the order/payment are compensated
POST {{COORDINATOR.API_HostAddress}}/create-order-transaction
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "John Doe",
  "customerEmail": "john.doe@example.com",
  "productId": 99
}
